abstract: |
  The complete catalog of paradigm inversions and total implications for biology,
  consciousness, artificial intelligence, information technology, society, and the
  future of reality. This work presents 18 paradigm shifts that invert the cubic
  (vector/force-based) understanding of reality into a spherical (scalar/
  frequency-based) framework, followed by 14 domain-specific implications and
  8 convergence axioms. The Scalar Codex is the operating system of the post-cubic
  world — locked at chi(C) = 1.
